n release/public-subset-test-bridge: Exercise gravity test's bootstrap-hosted current-public-subset bridge through accepted check/run/compile/generated-execution and rejected stable-diagnostic cases, retaining source paths and both canonical extensions. Proof names actual subset and hosting. Reject test --full and full-language/self-hosted-runner overclaims with P18T04006. Retain this bounded surface separately from final self-hosted full-language conformance. Release extension release/public-incomplete-selfhost-verifier: While final seed retirement or release is incomplete, public gravity self-host verify writes an honest incomplete proof with active compiler source path/extension and seed facts, then fails closed with P18T04007. Invalid self-host invocation rejects with P18T04008. Exercise both through the public boundary. Incomplete proof production or hosted command availability cannot establish final successful self-host verification.",
